  "description": "Core package containing shared models, interfaces, and abstractions for the AzureStorage.Standard library suite. This package provides common types used across Azure Blob Storage, Queue Storage, Table Storage, and File Share clients. Includes storage configuration models (StorageOptions), retry policies (RetryOptions), exception types (AzureStorageException), and shared domain models. This package is automatically installed as a dependency when you install any of the AzureStorage.Standard client packages (Blobs, Queues, Tables, Files). You typically don't need to install this package directly.",
